<title>USA: Intl Paper unit to distribute IBM products.</title>
<headline>Intl Paper unit to distribute IBM products.</headline>
<dateline>COVINGTON, Ky. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>ResourceNet International, a unit of International Paper Co, on Wednesday said it will exclusively distribute International Business Machines Corp's IBM brand printing and imaging papers.</p>
<p>ResourceNet will market the new IBM line in North America and Mexico through its network of wholesale and retail operations. The products will be available by September.</p>
<p>Financial details of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
